== Summary of modifications ==

This directory is a derivative work that rewrites the original
`evolve` skill to be agentic-tool-agnostic, matching the companion
`skills/agent-harness/` skill it hands off to and from. In particular:

- Replaced fixed Claude Code paths (`.claude/agents/`, `.claude/skills/`,
  `CLAUDE.md`) with guidance to use whatever agent/skill convention the
  host project already has.
- Replaced the reference to the upstream `harness` skill's "v1 to v2
  migration" procedure (a leftover-API cleanup step specific to two
  prior versions of the Claude Code plugin) with a pointer to
  `agent-harness`'s "Porting an existing tool-specific harness" guidance.
- Renamed the skill from `evolve` to `agent-harness-evolve`, and renamed
  all references to the companion skill from `harness` to
  `agent-harness`, to avoid colliding with the upstream Claude Code
  plugin's own namespace.
- Translated the document from Korean to English; all five workflow
  phases (collect the delta, classify feedback, generalize and apply,
  update the change log, report) and the three guiding principles are
  preserved from the original.
- Added this NOTICE file and copied LICENSE verbatim, as required by
  the Apache License, Version 2.0.

See `skills/agent-harness/NOTICE` for the fuller summary of changes made
across the whole ported harness (this skill's sibling).
